# Task Tracker CLI 📋

A simple command-line task manager built with Python that helps you organize your todos with local JSON storage.

## ✨ Features
- Add new tasks with descriptions
- List all tasks with completion status
- Mark tasks as complete
- Delete tasks you no longer need
- Data persists in JSON file between sessions

